Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.07,0:02:24.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来为您播报世界头条消息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非洲在持续干旱的情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:28.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为寻觅水源
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:32.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生成群的火鹳鸟\N在一夕之间消失的怪现象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:36.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为油轮漏出的原油\N而让苦无居所的海鸟群
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:39.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也在不知不觉中全都消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔…这真的很诡异耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:44.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.79,0:02:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又要说\N它们是被外星人带走的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一种像鸟的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄的想法太幼稚了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:02:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外星人是长得像鱆鱼耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:59.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得\N大雄说得也很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(世界候鸟野鸟分布图)\N从这次的共同研究我查到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.61,0:03:07.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界上有很多关于鸟人的传说喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:08.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟人？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.22,0:03:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外型像鸟的人类\N叫做鸟人没错吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N一定是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:14.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:17.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个古亚述时代的精灵图像…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然身体是人的样子\N可是却有老鹰的头跟翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:27.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 埃及神荷鲁斯\N它的脸是老鹰身体却是人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日本也有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:31.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:32.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乌鸦天狗很明显的就是鸟人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这些全都是外星人喽？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:39.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实话也不能说得这么肯定啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:41.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是说不定真的有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快把这些做完吧…\N鸟人…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:52.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:28.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:48.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.21,0:05:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要像鸟一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自由的在天空飞翔？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.15,0:05:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竹蜻蜓拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.15,0:05:57.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说鸟人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:05:58.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:00.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.59,0:06:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超人不就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:29.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超人 我是哆啦哆啦超人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:31.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是像鸟的人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:34.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像鸟的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说我不想靠引擎或马达
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:41.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要靠自己的力量在天空飞翔啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:42.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:47.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一天终于让我等到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.07,0:06:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次妈妈要你做事\N你就说“快拿出法宝来”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:53.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫你做功课\N你也说“快拿出法宝来”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次只想轻松不肯吃苦的大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:07:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算愿意靠自己的力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.45,0:07:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不知道\N我期盼这一天期盼多久了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道\N我不能一直这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太有骨气了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:08.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.39,0:07:09.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.89,0:07:13.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以让我靠自己飞起来的法宝\N快拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:14.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\N这要靠你自己动手做才对呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:19.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:23.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:27.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N我就是想做像这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:29.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么决定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.25,0:07:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先找材料…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:36.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种东西怎么可能飞得起来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.25,0:07:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是先别浇他冷水…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:09.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:14.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到山上试飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:16.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.03,0:08:20.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的做得很用心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.43,0:08:23.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…你听我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我要飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:33.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:38.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好下面先铺好气垫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:44.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可不要多管闲事喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.95,0:08:46.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是好心没好报
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:48.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该飞得起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:52.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 人类的力量根本就…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次我一定要飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.83,0:08:55.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别试了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:18.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看他这么认真\N我实在无法阻止他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.49,0:09:23.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要用气垫啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.59,0:09:24.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:26.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摆了气垫我反而容易松懈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇…飞起来了飞起来了\N根本没有飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.87,0:09:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类的力量根本就是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:43.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好想靠自己的力量飞起来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.61,0:09:45.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 我要对你另眼看待了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:48.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唔 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:51.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:54.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的小哔飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.39,0:09:56.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它有没有飞到这边来？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:57.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:09:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.05,0:10:20.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你在干么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:21.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:22.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:29.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小夫 我们快过去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.43,0:10:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得是这个方向啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:33.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的太突然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:35.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他刚才还闪过小哔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:39.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:50.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…鸟吗？\N还是人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:54.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真的是鸟的羽毛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说…是鸟人？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.35,0:10:57.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么会开着这种飞机\N突然从天空冒出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.32,0:11:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.09,0:11:06.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他好像受伤了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.59,0:11:08.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想办法帮帮他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:11.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是被人发现的话\N一定会引起一阵骚动的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:14.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隐形喷雾剂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:18.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来\N就可以把飞机藏起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:20.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 你过来背他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我来背啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:24.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先带他回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好这会是个大事件喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么找不到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.99,0:11:33.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.99,0:11:36.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来是这个方向没错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.23,0:11:38.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事绝对不能告诉任何人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:42.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然啰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他好像醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.89,0:12:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人…类…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:10.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面在吵什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.43,0:12:14.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,羽毛？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:15.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:18.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又开始偷偷的养什么东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.67,0:12:22.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要怕\N我们不会对你怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:24.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的…雪鹅号…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.41,0:12:28.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们弄去哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雪…鹅…号？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:32.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说的是那架飞机吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:35.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把它藏在\N你刚才摔下来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:37.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放心 不会被发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.29,0:12:39.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:43.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们快带我去\N雪鹅号藏匿的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:44.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 糟糕\N妈妈上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:58.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 哆啦A梦你怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:13:01.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我…好像有点发烧…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又好像没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.58,0:13:07.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又在玩花样了\N我拿很～苦的药给你吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 你在那里干什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:14.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…里头什么东西也没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.59,0:13:16.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.09,0:13:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要检查
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他应该是跑去\N藏飞机的那座山里了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:32.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁他还没被发现的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想去哪里啊\N大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:39.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然你真的想养鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:43.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好啊 妈妈绝对不会答应
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉 好个独家消息就这么飞了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:51.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天都黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们明天再来找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是有什么东西掉下来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.76,0:13:58.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小夫\N这件事也不能让大雄知道喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.01,0:14:08.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底藏到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得是在这附近呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:27.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:29.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.05,0:14:46.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:50.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明有翅膀却飞不起来啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:56.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们人类为什么会飞啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:14:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去漆喷雾剂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.06,0:15:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 它在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 雪鹅号
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…都摔坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:11.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来要把这个修理好的话\N可能要花一些时间了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:13.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.07,0:15:15.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 我自己来就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:18.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到现在还不相信我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:26.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:30.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的名字叫古斯基啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:32.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:34.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不是从宇宙来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.86,0:15:38.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是哪里呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:42.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…我不能说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:47.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看在飞机还没修好之前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:49.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就暂时先躲在这里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:52.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟箱型露营胶囊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这么小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.75,0:15:55.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看着好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:03.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的话视野应该也不错\N就这里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再设置个随意电梯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:10.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本电梯前往鸟箱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.17,0:16:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来里面这么宽敞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:23.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实里面并不大啦\N是我们变小了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:27.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 这里的视野好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:28.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:31.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么会有\N这么不可思议的力量呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:34.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实真正厉害的\N只有哆啦A梦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿…这也没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:48.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小哔…飞到哪里去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望它平安无事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:55.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 你就好好的休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:57.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们明天再来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.35,0:16:59.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:12.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是大家知道我在人类的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.03,0:17:15.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会很惊讶吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:20.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没想到\N我会受到人类的帮助…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:38.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真有这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:40.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你每次都这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背上有翅膀像鸟的人类…\N还说在屋顶上跑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定跟我们\N昨天看到的东西有关连
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:56.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许就像太郎说的\N是“鸟人外型的外星人”吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这肯定是个劲爆消息
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:00.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.54,0:18:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N不行告诉大雄对不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.98,0:18:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 开始动手修理啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 大家早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.35,0:18:15.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安 昨晚睡得好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸亏有你们的帮忙\N我的精神都恢复了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.59,0:18:20.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天说好今天要来帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:22.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:24.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个机翼坏成这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:26.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个用得上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:28.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我自己做的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然看起来快破掉了…\N应该可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:42.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,固体灯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:44.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用它来补强一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.99,0:18:47.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 那边帮我扶一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄他做得好起劲喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 再右边一点…\N好…可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 你要抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:05.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着修螺旋桨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.34,0:19:08.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:10.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要扶好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:12.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗 我要试喽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 去转一下踏板看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:16.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 再多转几下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.03,0:19:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个就像兄弟一样耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 大功告成了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.53,0:19:32.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就能飞起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:33.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:35.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.77,0:19:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就来试飞看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:43.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是谁说有鸟人外星人的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:48.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.45,0:19:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:52.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.79,0:19:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 这不是昨天坠机的残骸吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.32,0:19:57.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:59.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该还在这附近才对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:10.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:18.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:20.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…是外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:23.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小夫 别让他逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:32.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:32.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.90,0:20:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:38.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:47.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:48.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:49.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:55.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 跟昨天一样的洞穴…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.95,0:20:59.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:10.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:11.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.23,0:21:13.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜可能是时空隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:14.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时空隧道？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.97,0:21:18.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是普通的鸟耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:23.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里到底通往哪里啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.74,0:21:25.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 这样很危险耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.48,0:21:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要带我们去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 这是哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快放我们下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.24,0:21:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快放我们下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎 你看…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.55,0:22:05.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 这些家伙是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.49,0:22:13.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊 我们穿过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是什么地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.98,0:22:36.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我的竹蜻蜓…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.95,0:22:38.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电池没了\N快下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:47.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.09,0:22:47.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.37,0:23:04.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不知道\N绿色的全都任你挑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.51,0:23:07.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.82,0:23:13.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,母鸡小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.49,0:23:15.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有你的限时信喔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.99,0:23:17.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.83,0:23:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.13,0:23:22.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 是公鸡先生寄来的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.36,0:23:28.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快一点呀 鹳鸟婆婆\N已经快下蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:30.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.77,0:23:33.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快一点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.14,0:23:37.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘻 鹳鸟是接生婆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.38,0:23:40.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塘鹅最适合当邮差先生了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了\N这里就是古斯基居住的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:47.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来真的有鸟人世界耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.35,0:23:48.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.02,0:23:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.86,0:23:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 这几个都是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.36,0:23:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,队长 这家伙是只猫耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:23:59.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真的是猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.60,0:24:05.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算有人认出我是猫来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.37,0:24:09.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦\N现在不是感动的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.91,0:24:11.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫是鸟的大敌
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.05,0:24:13.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.45,0:24:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要跑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.16,0:24:23.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要跑到哪里去才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.09,0:24:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.89,0:24:25.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:30.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶路的小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.13,0:24:33.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.43,0:24:34.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦 快走呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.64,0:24:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶路的话\N要不要搭驼鸟计程车啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.14,0:24:38.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计程车？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.14,0:24:39.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先坐上去再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.17,0:24:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问要去哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.64,0:24:43.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快往前走就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.84,0:24:45.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.71,0:24:48.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.65,0:24:51.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,避免被甩出去请抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.09,0:24:54.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太太 您还满意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.42,0:24:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在太喜欢这个发型了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.42,0:24:58.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢您的光临
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.66,0:24:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.97,0:25:10.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么有这么粗暴的计程车啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.50,0:25:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.68,0:25:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.75,0:25:24.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 大家排队过马路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.89,0:25:25.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.92,0:25:27.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.02,0:25:28.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行走
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.46,0:25:31.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过马路的时候要小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.73,0:25:36.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.20,0:25:38.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们追上来了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.47,0:25:40.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就走旁边的小路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.47,0:25:41.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.97,0:25:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们往那边跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.74,0:25:48.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面的路会越来越窄
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:50.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你们抓紧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.32,0:25:59.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头快弯下去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.00,0:26:09.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.80,0:26:11.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经把警备队甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.00,0:26:13.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.71,0:26:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你们保重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.79,0:26:35.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经干了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.82,0:26:37.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来该怎么办哪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.79,0:26:40.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之先去找胖虎他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.53,0:26:45.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好壮观的建筑物喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.37,0:26:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不要太过分喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.04,0:26:57.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.38,0:26:58.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快躲到这里面
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.55,0:27:01.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么我都不会听的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.12,0:27:08.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要每次\N一有人类侵入就找我来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.09,0:27:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.06,0:27:14.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.56,0:27:16.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 主人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.80,0:27:19.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唔…好重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.10,0:27:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真搞不懂滋古连度在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.10,0:27:54.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我应该不会出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.35,0:28:06.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们进去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.35,0:28:09.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许能得到一些情报喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.39,0:28:14.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来这里好像是个\N考古学家住的地方耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.86,0:28:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.62,0:28:17.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太郎给我们看过这个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.42,0:28:19.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像荷鲁斯的像喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.63,0:28:23.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说的话\N很久以前就跟地球有关…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.63,0:28:27.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.10,0:28:28.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:30.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.64,0:28:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一路追着你结果就…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.41,0:28:36.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是稀客啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.91,0:28:38.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类的小孩跟…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.65,0:28:40.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…一只狸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.68,0:28:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.65,0:28:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一只机器猫
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.89,0:28:50.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄跟静香\N都是我的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.22,0:28:52.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的好朋友猫头鹰博士
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.93,0:28:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.83,0:28:55.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.83,0:28:58.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又随便跑到\N人类的世界去了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.90,0:28:59.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.97,0:29:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 刚才那两个人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.00,0:29:05.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能被乌鸦警备队抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.69,0:29:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放我们去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.36,0:29:29.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.43,0:29:31.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你们揍得扁扁的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.70,0:29:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滋古连度长官\N就是这两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.94,0:29:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是他们的老大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.21,0:29:43.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快放我们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.74,0:29:47.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么凶暴 的确是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.41,0:29:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官 该怎么处置他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.22,0:29:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然是人类的话那就不必审判
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.95,0:29:54.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻处刑
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.96,0:29:56.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,处刑？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.89,0:29:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么可以随便决定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.03,0:30:00.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便决定？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.46,0:30:01.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么蠢话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.70,0:30:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们人类的一意孤行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.73,0:30:06.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会造成\N无计其数的鸟类受到迫害
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.23,0:30:08.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天就处刑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.70,0:30:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.04,0:30:11.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.97,0:30:13.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.24,0:30:16.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟托邦…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.78,0:30:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.51,0:30:21.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟托邦是从人类的世界中\N被隔绝出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.95,0:30:23.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么是隔绝啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.48,0:30:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是离很远不能往来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.75,0:30:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里跟你们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.99,0:30:31.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是由一个叫鸟航道的超空间\N连接起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.79,0:30:34.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中一个\N是跟后山连接在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.93,0:30:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是为什么我们不知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.76,0:30:42.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个入口只有\N鸟类跟我们鸟人知道而已
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:45.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且也不会停留在同一个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.51,0:30:47.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才一直没有被人发现
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.01,0:30:48.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.58,0:30:51.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要赶快想办法\N救救胖虎跟小夫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.01,0:30:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 对喔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.85,0:30:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.01,0:30:57.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 就这样走出去的话\N马上又会被追捕
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.52,0:31:00.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.25,0:31:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新型小鸟帽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.02,0:31:08.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要戴上这个\N我们就可以变成跟鸟人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.80,0:31:11.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的是鸭子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.73,0:31:13.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的是天鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.37,0:31:19.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔…真是太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.54,0:31:20.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可以飞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.81,0:31:22.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以喽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.34,0:31:24.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.25,0:31:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.31,0:31:28.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.08,0:31:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以帮忙带路吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.48,0:31:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我的雪鹅号又故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.55,0:31:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又坏掉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.59,0:31:36.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我载你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.06,0:31:39.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦\N你可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.06,0:31:40.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.06,0:31:46.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈 这哪飞得起来嘛\N我戴的是企鹅的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.60,0:31:50.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放心 这次我已经换成白鸽帽了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.57,0:31:57.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要对我们处什么刑啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.84,0:32:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屁股打一千下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.08,0:32:01.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.35,0:32:03.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快放我们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.12,0:32:04.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别作梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.62,0:32:06.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 你出将军
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.35,0:32:08.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赢了…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.59,0:32:10.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉底球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.66,0:32:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个等一下会沉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.39,0:32:14.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们趁机去拿钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.20,0:32:17.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.30,0:32:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 就差那么一步
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.87,0:32:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.14,0:32:26.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在 快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.11,0:32:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 怎么搞的\N胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.88,0:32:30.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 怎么搞的\N小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.04,0:32:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.58,0:32:33.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.41,0:32:35.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在还没人来 快逃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.05,0:32:36.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 你不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.58,0:32:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 原来是你在搞鬼\N给我记住
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.89,0:32:41.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遗忘草
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.62,0:32:44.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 让你们忘得一干二净
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.39,0:32:48.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚才在做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.40,0:32:49.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.40,0:32:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家动作快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.90,0:32:53.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见…要保重喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.40,0:32:56.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了 我要回家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.90,0:33:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能还要再多调查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.41,0:33:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.14,0:33:03.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我不好 害了大家
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.98,0:33:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.68,0:33:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得能交上古斯基这个朋友\N我们再多待一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.42,0:33:12.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你叫古斯基啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.15,0:33:13.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.59,0:33:15.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我们两个也有责任
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.46,0:33:16.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么责任啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.66,0:33:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得来到这里\N我们就多开开眼界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.09,0:33:23.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦\N你也给我们那种帽子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.16,0:33:24.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.70,0:33:25.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.60,0:33:31.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈 啄木鸟耶\N太适合你了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.27,0:33:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的是…信天翁耶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.94,0:33:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信天翁又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.21,0:33:40.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了\N别吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.48,0:33:43.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 胖虎人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.95,0:33:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信天翁都要先助跑才行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.79,0:33:52.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.19,0:33:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你们久等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.74,0:34:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来事情是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.74,0:34:07.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是为什么\N他们一听到我们是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.41,0:34:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就对我们这么不友善啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.08,0:34:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.04,0:34:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滋古连度长官\N非常憎恨人类的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.68,0:34:16.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,憎恨人类\N为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.42,0:34:19.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他曾经被枪打中
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.29,0:34:25.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟托邦有一支候鸟巡逻队
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.79,0:34:29.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的任务是监视世界的候鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.67,0:34:37.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,候鸟具有特别的能力\N所以不会迷路找不到方向
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.47,0:34:41.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然其中也会有迷路的候鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.71,0:34:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将这些候鸟引导到正确的航道\N或是保护他们的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.11,0:34:49.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是候鸟巡逻队的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.95,0:34:56.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滋古连度就是在巡逻当中\N被无情的人类用枪打中翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.06,0:34:58.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好过分喔
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.63,0:35:02.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那个时候开始\N他就变得相当憎恨人类
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.73,0:35:07.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来地球上的鸟类\N跟人类就是要和平共处
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.63,0:35:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.34,0:35:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家要想想\N能为彼此做些什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.64,0:35:14.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是我们鸟人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.44,0:35:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或你们人类都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.54,0:35:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博士说的一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.51,0:35:19.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.25,0:35:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.41,0:35:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我也知道\N也有像你们这样的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.12,0:35:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们帮助古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.75,0:35:30.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雪鹅号\N是博士跟我一起做出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.06,0:35:31.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.93,0:35:34.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实几乎都是\N古斯基一个人完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.93,0:35:37.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考古学才是我的专长啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.06,0:35:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难怪这里全都是一些旧东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.57,0:35:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别碰那个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.47,0:35:44.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 吓到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.07,0:35:48.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个非常古老的石碑\N很容易就会碎掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.11,0:35:54.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这上面刻的传闻\N或许会改变鸟托邦未来的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.58,0:35:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是去年\N从鸟栖木的根挖掘出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.29,0:36:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟栖木？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.59,0:36:01.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.02,0:36:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.16,0:36:07.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.06,0:36:12.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的顶端一直都有云笼罩着
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.63,0:36:14.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家把它叫做“烟环”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.10,0:36:17.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在还没有人进去过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.41,0:36:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟栖木在我们鸟人诞生的时候\N就一直持续的成长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.62,0:36:34.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 它到底有多高\N顶端上面有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.65,0:36:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.95,0:37:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是我家
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.48,0:37:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没回家不会挨骂呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:05.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.75,0:37:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是在练习飞行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.59,0:37:09.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.79,0:37:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.96,0:37:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.29,0:37:16.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 你听我说啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.20,0:37:17.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫米露啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.13,0:37:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？是你的新朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.20,0:37:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好 我是住在隔壁的米露
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.67,0:37:26.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 我们是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.17,0:37:29.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把古斯基带出去玩的\N就是你们对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.31,0:37:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.31,0:37:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去练习开雪鹅号啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.78,0:37:35.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别找藉口了\N也不跟我讲一声就跑出去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.48,0:37:37.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她好像是古斯基的女朋友哟
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.72,0:37:38.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.69,0:37:44.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 真是热闹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.52,0:37:47.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎古斯基的朋友来家里玩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.33,0:37:49.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就留下来吃晚饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.60,0:37:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈做的菜很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.87,0:37:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 就知道撒娇\N你要多多反省才对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.84,0:37:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N爸爸人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.87,0:38:01.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滋古连度长官\N跟巴比伦队长现在刚好来家里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.61,0:38:04.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滋古连度长官在我们家啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.85,0:38:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能在这份文件上签名
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.09,0:38:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.69,0:38:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了保护我们鸟托邦\N跟地球上的鸟类
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.59,0:38:22.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不被人类迫害的\N最终计划同意书
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.86,0:38:29.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就剩下猫头鹰博士\N还有你这位环境长官
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.74,0:38:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要签了名就能在议会通过
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.04,0:38:33.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.14,0:38:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不赞成这个计划
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.74,0:38:39.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您再考虑清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.71,0:38:42.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类确实是我们鸟类的劲敌
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.65,0:38:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也不能因为这样\N就草率决定
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.76,0:38:54.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.29,0:38:56.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是这么会吃
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.23,0:38:58.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好吃嘛 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.10,0:38:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.70,0:39:00.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.57,0:39:01.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.70,0:39:02.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.14,0:39:06.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.94,0:39:07.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.97,0:39:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.65,0:39:13.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.31,0:39:14.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.98,0:39:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基也很厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.45,0:39:18.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我要参加伊卡洛斯耐力赛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.75,0:39:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不多增强一些体力的话\N那怎么行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.99,0:39:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么是伊卡洛斯耐力赛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.99,0:39:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是候鸟巡逻队的入队测验
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.83,0:39:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是以传说中的鸟人\N伊卡洛斯命名的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.70,0:39:36.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要加入巡逻队的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.30,0:39:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要通过技术速度\N还有持久力的比赛来决定
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.81,0:39:44.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会带着雪鹅号参加的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.31,0:39:46.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才一直不断的练习
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.02,0:39:50.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会用翅膀飞的人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.85,0:39:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能在\N伊卡洛斯耐力赛中获胜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.95,0:39:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这未免也太天真了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.36,0:40:00.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之你就多尽力练习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.13,0:40:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.40,0:40:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.66,0:40:06.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基是有原因才飞不起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.83,0:40:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是没有办法的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.53,0:40:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有原因？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.35,0:40:53.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这样所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.95,0:40:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次当我想用自己的翅膀\N飞看看的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.82,0:41:00.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会想起\N当初那种恐怖的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.59,0:41:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.09,0:41:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从我的耳朵被咬过一次之后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.29,0:41:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在还很怕老鼠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.39,0:41:10.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 没关系\N我还有雪鹅号啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.50,0:41:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.46,0:41:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再怎么说你都是\N靠自己的力量飞起来的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.57,0:41:16.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然有这个难得的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.30,0:41:18.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就一起去帮古斯基加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.87,0:41:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.04,0:41:21.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.27,0:41:23.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也来参加比赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.61,0:41:27.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来满有意思的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.11,0:41:28.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的要参加啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.61,0:41:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是当然的喽
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.92,0:41:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我决定要参加两卡洛斯耐力赛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.62,0:41:34.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎 是伊卡洛斯啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.05,0:41:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管它一卡两卡还不都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.12,0:41:38.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差太多了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.86,0:41:43.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天就开始练习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.36,0:41:45.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 今天晚上早一点睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.00,0:41:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先等一下好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.57,0:41:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.87,0:41:51.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 厕所在哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.54,0:41:53.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.91,0:41:56.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…下楼之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.91,0:41:59.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.65,0:42:03.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？我走错了吗…？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.15,0:42:07.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.62,0:42:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟蛋啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.27,0:42:26.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了…发生什么事了…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.27,0:42:27.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇…好可爱哟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.47,0:42:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长得好像小夫喔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.08,0:42:30.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 是个男孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.51,0:42:33.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是我的弟弟喽
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.18,0:42:37.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想怎么样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.63,0:42:49.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.13,0:42:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓…尼…基…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.90,0:42:55.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果真如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.37,0:43:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基…太可怕了…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.97,0:43:02.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.18,0:43:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我听错了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.02,0:43:13.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.55,0:43:16.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定没听错？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.09,0:43:17.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.09,0:43:21.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫头鹰博士边看着石碑\N嘴里是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.83,0:43:25.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基的存在终于被证实了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.03,0:43:28.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.84,0:43:30.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基是指…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.14,0:43:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被封印在遥远古代\N一股强势的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.51,0:43:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫头鹰博士\N在我还尊他为师的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.61,0:43:42.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就已经投入毕生心血\N从事腓尼基的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.68,0:43:45.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 要是我们\N能得到这个力量的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.89,0:43:48.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是那个顽固的环境长官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.75,0:43:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是反对我们的人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.52,0:43:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也都对我们束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.16,0:43:54.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.73,0:43:58.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那几个该处刑的人类也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.90,0:44:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 属下该死
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.00,0:44:04.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,负责看守的人\N都不记得发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.71,0:44:09.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还求证到\N有另外两个人类跟一只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.58,0:44:14.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是让人类世界知道\N我们的计划那就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.28,0:44:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不快去把他们抓回来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.15,0:44:17.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.94,0:44:45.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些从人类世界带过来的鸟\N在这里自由自在的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.58,0:44:47.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有受伤的鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.51,0:44:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就等它们的伤恢复之后\N再让它们回去原来的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.49,0:44:55.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看那些企鹅好像是\N电视上报导的失踪企鹅耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.96,0:44:57.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都没错耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.26,0:45:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是朱鹭耶\N好漂亮喔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.16,0:45:05.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让一些快要绝种的鸟类繁殖\N再让它们回去人类的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.23,0:45:08.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我那个\N身为环境长官的父亲的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.30,0:45:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小哔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.14,0:45:16.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 你平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.64,0:45:17.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.18,0:45:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为它跑到哪里去了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.11,0:45:23.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要开始练习喽
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.15,0:45:26.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们听清楚喔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.29,0:45:29.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边那个中央厅\N是伊卡洛耐力赛的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.16,0:45:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依照路标飞完一圈\N然后折返
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.09,0:45:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后在鸟栖木的烟环正下方\N插上自己的羽毛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.87,0:45:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还不简单
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.17,0:45:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就错了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.67,0:45:45.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,途中设置了许多障碍物
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.37,0:45:48.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总而言之速度是最基本的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.37,0:45:51.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来比赛看谁先飞到\N对面的山崖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.78,0:45:54.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.48,0:46:00.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.65,0:46:02.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 出发喽
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.32,0:46:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.59,0:46:06.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 你可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.86,0:46:08.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.49,0:46:10.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的感觉好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.23,0:46:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞的好快喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.61,0:46:24.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会输呢\N看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.72,0:46:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的有够快的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.22,0:46:38.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,速度不够快的\N话根本无法获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.53,0:46:41.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非参加不可吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.23,0:46:43.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我还是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.76,0:46:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.60,0:46:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 我一定要拿到第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.90,0:46:49.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.74,0:46:51.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么大家再飞个十趟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.74,0:46:53.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十趟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.50,0:47:23.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有信心 我相信\N明天我一定会获胜的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.74,0:47:29.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.15,0:47:33.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.38,0:47:36.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.38,0:47:38.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.45,0:48:06.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位观众请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.25,0:48:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟托邦最盛大的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.25,0:48:12.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯耐力赛\N的比赛时间即将到来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.42,0:48:14.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在中央贵宾席上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.99,0:48:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本大会委员长大老鹰总理\N以及各级长官也都列席参加
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.96,0:48:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各个参赛者\N已经都集合在起跑点上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.13,0:48:26.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家加油
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.14,0:48:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.27,0:48:30.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会全力以赴的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.60,0:48:32.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫头鹰博士好像没有来耶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.94,0:48:34.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能正在忙着他的研究吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.04,0:48:37.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.78,0:48:40.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.28,0:48:42.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也要出场比赛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.05,0:48:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为用这个废物\N就可以获胜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.65,0:48:49.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你能飞完全程的话\N我服了你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.06,0:48:50.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.46,0:48:52.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是男子汉的话\N别只靠那张嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.66,0:48:54.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家拿出实力来比个高下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.50,0:48:55.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.66,0:48:58.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米露 你也要出场比赛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.57,0:48:59.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.87,0:49:02.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是负责照顾古斯基的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.30,0:49:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.51,0:49:06.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.51,0:49:08.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们等着瞧好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.01,0:49:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.21,0:49:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让各位久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.54,0:49:13.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在请大老鹰总理\N来为大家说几句话
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.82,0:49:26.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在将开始举行伊卡洛斯\N候鸟巡逻队的入队测验
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.30,0:49:37.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,测验结果的判定\N由巴比伦队长全权负责
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.94,0:49:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了选手以外\N其他人请退出比赛场外
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.88,0:49:47.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.39,0:49:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,个位选手 请就定位
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.23,0:50:02.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,预备…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.86,0:50:05.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.08,0:50:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各个选手几乎同时起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.85,0:50:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底谁是第一个飞回来的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.62,0:50:30.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后在鸟栖木上\N插上羽毛的人又会是谁呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.14,0:50:43.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.70,0:51:13.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉 我已经失去资格了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.48,0:51:23.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个顽固的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.31,0:51:25.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不可能获胜的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.05,0:51:30.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.12,0:51:35.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.13,0:51:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好险哪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.63,0:51:48.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小夫 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.27,0:51:49.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.14,0:52:57.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.91,0:52:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.91,0:53:00.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们先走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.29,0:53:20.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米露 这里很危险\N赶快离开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.60,0:53:30.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经看不到古斯基他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.37,0:53:32.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米露 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.81,0:53:38.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我翅膀被刚才的蜘蛛丝缠到\N变得不好飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.05,0:53:39.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.45,0:53:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.75,0:53:46.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的希望都寄托在你身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.33,0:54:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一组领先的选手已经回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.34,0:54:06.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着就是要\N一股作气的冲上鸟栖木
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.73,0:54:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.18,0:54:49.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太奸诈了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.32,0:54:51.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然用这种道具想要轻松过关
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.40,0:55:12.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.84,0:55:14.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会认输的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.34,0:55:51.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时到达
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.34,0:55:54.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,优胜者是\N燕太郎选手跟古斯基选手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.85,0:55:58.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,优胜者是\N燕太郎选手跟古斯基选手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.39,0:55:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.62,0:56:02.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够优胜实在是太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.79,0:56:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 古斯基这孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.99,0:56:07.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.94,0:56:22.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们用最热烈的掌声\N恭喜燕太郎选手跟古斯基选手
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.28,0:56:26.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且也给参赛选手\N一些鼓励的掌声
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.78,0:56:31.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.75,0:56:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎跟小夫也尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.79,0:56:36.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我比大雄厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.92,0:56:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是一样 大雄太差劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.46,0:56:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.10,0:56:47.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的比赛结果有更动
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.04,0:56:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在请巴比伦队长为大家发表
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.84,0:56:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如同各位看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.47,0:56:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基选手在这次比赛中\N的确表现相当出色
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.28,0:56:59.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是他的飞行\N并不是靠自己的翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.41,0:57:02.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是靠其他道具来完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.68,0:57:07.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这种情况下我们可以认定\N他是真正的优胜者吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.35,0:57:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了不让伟大的伊卡洛斯\N的名誉受到屈辱
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.42,0:57:14.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们宣布古斯基选手失去这个资格
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.70,0:57:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,优胜者就燕太郎选手一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.57,0:57:22.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪有这种事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.74,0:57:23.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.64,0:57:25.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有搞错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.51,0:57:26.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.74,0:57:30.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡是靠自己的翅膀\N飞完全程的选手
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.38,0:57:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部都有资格加入巡逻队的行列
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.31,0:57:34.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报告完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.09,0:57:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠自己的翅膀…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.14,0:58:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博士
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.98,0:58:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请原谅我下属的无礼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.48,0:58:09.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏你多年的研究\N让腓尼基的力量成为我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.38,0:58:14.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来所有的一切\N都会照我的预定完成
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.62,0:58:15.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恨的人类啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.69,0:58:17.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.12,0:58:20.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我复仇的时机来了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.80,0:58:23.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴比伦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.63,0:58:26.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天一早立刻出动巡逻队
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.77,0:58:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.39,0:58:50.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后我还是要\N靠自己的翅膀飞起来才行哪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.56,0:58:53.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦\N你能不能想想办法？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.43,0:58:54.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这的确是有点难啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.93,0:58:57.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.03,0:58:59.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们明天就要出动了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.93,0:59:01.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.30,0:59:04.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也稍微体谅一下\N古斯基的心情好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.95,0:59:22.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 把自己关在房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.62,0:59:25.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是让他静一静吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.46,0:59:28.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得古斯基\N这次被宣布失去资格的背后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.06,0:59:30.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么隐情喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.07,0:59:33.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.57,0:59:41.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.38,0:59:44.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.99,0:59:56.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.46,1:00:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这支新的候鸟巡逻队\N即将执行首次的任务
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.59,1:00:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管在什么情况下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.46,1:00:05.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对要服从命令
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.30,1:00:06.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.53,1:00:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.87,1:00:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都是被挑选出来勇者
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.27,1:00:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在首次任务中\N要尽情发挥你们的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.47,1:00:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,候鸟巡逻队 出动
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.40,1:00:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到古斯基了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.76,1:00:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.76,1:00:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都没有人看到他
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.43,1:00:41.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.27,1:00:44.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去猫头鹰博士家找过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.27,1:00:44.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.84,1:00:45.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.57,1:00:46.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.27,1:00:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫头鹰博士也不在耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.81,1:00:50.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.78,1:00:52.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.65,1:00:55.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这根羽毛是警备队的…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.52,1:00:59.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是博士很很重视的石碑碎片
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.82,1:01:02.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博士一定是在滋古连度长官那里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.52,1:01:04.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事情 果然是有问题
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.16,1:01:07.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要先找到古斯基才行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.19,1:01:42.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.60,1:01:46.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.90,1:01:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你们不要管我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.84,1:01:52.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想自己试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.74,1:01:56.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样\N我一定要靠自己的翅膀飞起来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.28,1:01:57.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.28,1:01:59.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博士被抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.91,1:02:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.88,1:02:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是你的好朋友不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.98,1:02:06.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家同心协力的话\N一定可以把他救出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.62,1:02:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.79,1:02:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.52,1:02:10.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时你还满会讲话的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.86,1:02:11.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.93,1:02:14.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基\N你有没有什么线索呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.13,1:02:17.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许石碑上的文字\N已经解读出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.43,1:02:20.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时光包袱
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.13,1:02:23.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个可以让\N毁掉的石碑再恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.14,1:02:26.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是能知道上写什么就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.67,1:02:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就用翻译蒟蒻啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.11,1:02:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.24,1:02:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会把这个法宝给忘了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.05,1:02:36.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翻译蒟蒻
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.88,1:02:38.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.45,1:02:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面写什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.52,1:02:44.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基耸立于北方尽头
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.46,1:02:46.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉拉亚多山的龙之谷底下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.39,1:02:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙之谷？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.20,1:02:54.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基的力量\N好比神的强大力量
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.67,1:02:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假使唤醒腓尼基的力量的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.94,1:03:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到这里就没了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.04,1:03:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基的力量\N指的到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.81,1:03:05.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.28,1:03:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 这么一来全都明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.78,1:03:10.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滋古连度想要利用\N腓尼基的强大力量
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.98,1:03:14.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企图将鸟托邦占为己有
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.59,1:03:15.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.56,1:03:17.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去告诉伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.92,1:03:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯一定会知道\N腓尼基的力量是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.43,1:03:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯不是传说中的鸟人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.33,1:03:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是古代的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.00,1:03:29.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听猫头鹰博士说过…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.24,1:03:31.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他人在监狱岛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.08,1:03:38.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯为了负起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.81,1:03:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滋古连度在候鸟巡逻队时\N遭人类枪击的责任
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.18,1:03:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自愿被关进监狱岛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.96,1:04:23.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.29,1:04:26.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.16,1:04:27.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是伊卡洛斯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.46,1:04:31.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯 请你帮助我们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.97,1:04:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫头鹰博士被滋古连度抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.40,1:04:38.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去年被挖掘出来的石碑上写说
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.74,1:04:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基被封印在龙之谷
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.98,1:04:45.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滋古连度知道之后…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.45,1:04:49.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯\N请助我们一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.95,1:04:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.48,1:04:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去鸟托邦就会…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.13,1:05:09.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们快让
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.55,1:05:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个\N赶快过 来抓紧我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.53,1:05:41.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.40,1:05:43.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是传说中的羽翼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.78,1:05:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧蒂雅 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.78,1:06:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要称下去\N加油啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.06,1:06:05.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯 小宝宝…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.56,1:06:06.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.77,1:06:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是天空耶
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.18,1:06:23.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.11,1:06:26.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在要一口气\N飞到拉拉亚多山
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.28,1:06:27.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.73,1:06:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们终于到了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.09,1:06:44.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基的力量就是\N被封印在这个龙之谷下面
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.10,1:06:46.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要让这股力量重新复活
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.83,1:06:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后把人类世界的鸟类\N全都移居到这鸟托邦来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.14,1:06:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从持续破坏环境的人类手中\N把我们的同伴救出来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.88,1:06:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.85,1:07:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫头鹰博士？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.11,1:07:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是这么做的话
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.61,1:07:04.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类世界的生态\N就会变得很诡异
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.65,1:07:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟本来就应该跟人类一起生活
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.12,1:07:08.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.89,1:07:12.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把你带来这里\N并不是要听你大谈阔论的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.33,1:07:14.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我这个\N曾经跟你一起研究的人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.89,1:07:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分享研究成果也是应该的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.63,1:07:19.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要早点觉醒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.37,1:07:20.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.00,1:07:21.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.63,1:07:23.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 快放开博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.27,1:07:26.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这三个人关起来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.64,1:07:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人立刻把这个山谷的雪铲除
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.51,1:07:33.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.68,1:07:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.78,1:07:38.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好冷喔
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.65,1:07:40.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.89,1:07:42.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先降落一下好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.10,1:07:56.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是山谷的另一边
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.60,1:07:58.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么法宝快拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.67,1:08:00.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应变灯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.64,1:08:01.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个灯是…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.87,1:08:03.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了啦\N不用说明
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.21,1:08:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.28,1:08:07.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 不冷了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.38,1:08:08.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不可思议耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.51,1:08:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,静香跟我还有伊卡洛斯\N也一起来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.15,1:08:11.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.12,1:08:14.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯也会冷吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.39,1:08:15.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.89,1:08:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.16,1:08:22.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 大雄？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.43,1:08:24.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好没什么大碍
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.63,1:08:26.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 这是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.63,1:08:28.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好奇怪喔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.67,1:08:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是人类耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.94,1:08:35.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是立体影像
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.24,1:08:40.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫鸟野守\N是二十二世纪的鸟类学者
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.21,1:08:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二十二世纪？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.18,1:08:46.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌人类的我非常喜欢鸟
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.92,1:08:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我原本想跟小鸟们坐时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.22,1:08:56.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到哺乳类\N还没诞生的远古时代一起生活
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.01,1:09:12.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.01,1:09:18.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为时空乱流\N时光机撞上了超空间的墙壁
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.45,1:09:20.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会来到多元宇宙
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.59,1:09:27.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 我知道了\N原来这里是别的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.53,1:09:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然很意外\N不过这也是大好机会
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.86,1:09:35.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的话\N不必担心会改变人类历史
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.27,1:09:40.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时年轻的我\N如同被恶魔附了身一样…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.97,1:09:44.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了在这里建造一个鸟托邦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.01,1:09:49.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我任意将各种鸟类进化
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.52,1:09:58.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我教导鸟人\N所有我所知道的知识
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.06,1:10:00.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.26,1:10:04.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基的祖先\N是鸟野博士创造出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.80,1:10:06.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动作快 不行休息
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.93,1:10:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要把这个山谷的雪全都铲平
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.24,1:10:12.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基的力量是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.57,1:10:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.01,1:10:16.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么话 还不快做事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.81,1:10:23.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是鸟托邦也有鸟类的天敌
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.06,1:10:35.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最后的工作\N就是要想办法把它解决掉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.83,1:10:39.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我把它引诱到\N这个北端的山谷来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.67,1:10:41.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始爆破
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.55,1:10:58.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让它沉睡在这个冰山下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.48,1:11:01.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经完成了我的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.35,1:11:03.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟托邦的孩子们记住
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.69,1:11:07.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万不可以把腓尼基唤醒过来…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.59,1:11:11.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来腓尼基\N好像是一头巨大的猛兽
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.73,1:11:13.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们快赶过去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.57,1:11:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来它就是腓尼基的力量…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.07,1:11:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官 要唤醒它吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.98,1:11:27.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我怎么会没想到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.38,1:11:29.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以由我来控制它
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.38,1:11:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再把它\N从鸟托邦送到人类的世界去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.90,1:11:47.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.17,1:11:49.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我让你再度苏醒过来的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.94,1:11:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 你要听从我的指示
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.91,1:11:55.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.01,1:11:56.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.42,1:12:05.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基 给我安静下来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.45,1:12:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.19,1:12:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说中的英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.86,1:12:12.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.19,1:12:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.63,1:12:16.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.86,1:12:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.13,1:12:19.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好朋友你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.47,1:12:20.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.67,1:12:22.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.94,1:12:24.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快抓住伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.44,1:12:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.07,1:12:29.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吱古连度想要控制腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.91,1:12:32.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企图征服人类世界呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.78,1:12:34.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让他得逞的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.21,1:12:36.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这个…\N找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.18,1:12:39.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进化退化放射线源
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.29,1:12:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把开关调到退化
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.69,1:12:45.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你退化成变形虫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.56,1:12:46.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别管闲事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.46,1:12:48.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.17,1:12:54.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.67,1:12:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转到进化去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.17,1:13:03.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基又急速成长了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.18,1:13:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基 你要听从我的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.26,1:13:22.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.33,1:13:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.01,1:13:37.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.54,1:13:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴比伦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.44,1:13:40.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你照顾一下滋古连度
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.01,1:13:42.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.29,1:13:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基要去哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.53,1:13:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.53,1:13:58.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,归属的本能\N让它朝鸟托邦的方向去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.30,1:13:59.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟托邦有危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.03,1:14:04.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家把力量结合起来\N一起守护鸟托邦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.57,1:14:07.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦 我们也一起加入
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.87,1:14:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.97,1:14:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.58,1:14:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.48,1:14:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.26,1:14:33.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家不要慌乱\N快到山崖上避难
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.40,1:14:36.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会有这么可怕的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.44,1:14:39.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够战斗的人快拿起武器来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.67,1:14:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.31,1:14:43.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,候鸟巡逻队马上赶来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.01,1:14:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.34,1:15:11.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战况好激烈喔
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.70,1:15:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦 快拿武器来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.61,1:15:16.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说是武器\N其实就是我们惯用的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.24,1:15:18.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,空气炮跟休克枪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.04,1:15:22.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之先把腓尼基\N赶出鸟托邦再说
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.62,1:15:23.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.85,1:15:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,防身斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.85,1:15:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,静香 你们用这个\N带小朋友们去避难
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.72,1:15:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.16,1:15:33.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家听好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.33,1:15:34.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万要小心
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.57,1:15:45.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用 它根本不痛不痒
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.34,1:15:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.58,1:15:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.18,1:15:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有缩小电筒呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.01,1:15:55.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用这个把你缩到最小
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.98,1:15:59.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,防身斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.25,1:16:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.65,1:16:02.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有小河
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.19,1:16:03.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.66,1:16:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方应该就安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.66,1:16:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.49,1:16:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我的小哔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.43,1:16:12.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米露 你们在这里等我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.70,1:16:14.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.94,1:16:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样继续下去也治不了它
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.44,1:16:25.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基 你觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.88,1:16:29.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.78,1:16:31.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.15,1:16:35.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.03,1:16:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.90,1:16:45.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮了我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.46,1:16:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.63,1:16:47.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米露
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.73,1:16:48.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.23,1:16:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.84,1:16:53.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.21,1:16:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米露 静香人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.91,1:17:03.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小哔…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.92,1:17:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小哔…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.42,1:17:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 小哔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.22,1:17:12.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基根本就不怕休克枪
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.06,1:17:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,空气炮也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.69,1:17:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有更厉害的武器吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.43,1:17:17.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.16,1:17:20.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.47,1:17:26.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟野博士当初坐来的时光机\N或许会有什么武器也说不定喔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.07,1:17:30.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把腓尼基引诱出来\N然后把它解决掉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.01,1:17:31.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.68,1:17:34.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那台时光机在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.58,1:17:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.38,1:17:38.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个线索
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.02,1:17:42.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在鸟栖木的最顶端
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.52,1:17:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经穿过云层地带\N很仔细的看过
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.76,1:17:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看过时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.69,1:17:49.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.53,1:17:52.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去引诱腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.53,1:17:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.03,1:17:57.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯\N你的翅膀…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.80,1:18:01.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯你要撑着点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.87,1:18:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.98,1:18:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他大打算去引诱腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.71,1:18:10.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.89,1:18:22.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.29,1:18:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你尽量来追我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.40,1:18:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基已经朝鸟栖木飞去了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.00,1:18:32.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.57,1:18:33.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们快走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.53,1:18:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是云层地带
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.10,1:19:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.88,1:19:14.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.05,1:19:23.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.82,1:19:25.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.63,1:19:28.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道他们怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.83,1:19:31.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基一定做得到的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.70,1:19:33.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿出你的勇气来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.80,1:19:35.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞起来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.40,1:19:36.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.00,1:19:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.11,1:19:44.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.74,1:19:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.35,1:19:48.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.38,1:19:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你飞起来了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.82,1:19:56.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它来了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.12,1:19:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄就拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.02,1:19:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.89,1:19:59.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.40,1:20:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有种就就跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.61,1:20:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦\N我们要赶快找到时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.05,1:20:25.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这个时候要用…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.45,1:20:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 就用声音凝固剂
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.42,1:20:29.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可行喔
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.69,1:20:31.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声音凝固剂
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.79,1:20:34.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎 你快喝下去\N然后大声叫
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.93,1:20:36.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.21,1:20:53.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.21,1:20:57.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄\N你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.48,1:20:58.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.48,1:21:00.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 还好吧？\N大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.35,1:21:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.35,1:21:03.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.72,1:21:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到 鸟栖木的顶端\N是个湖泊耶
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.29,1:21:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些水一定是积了好几万年吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.73,1:21:13.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦 你看
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.13,1:21:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是鸟野博士的时光机啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.10,1:21:19.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 我们快走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.64,1:21:23.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道大雄他们有没有来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.68,1:21:24.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.68,1:21:28.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是机舱
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.25,1:21:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望电源没有故障才好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.75,1:21:34.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都已经荒废二亿年了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.45,1:21:39.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道还可不可以用
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.73,1:21:42.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该有设置什么武器才对
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.56,1:21:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.97,1:21:49.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休克炮 准备发射
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.70,1:21:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.60,1:21:52.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个东西一定可以打倒腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.97,1:21:54.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 快去通知古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.91,1:21:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.57,1:21:57.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的白鸽帽借我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.38,1:22:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.15,1:22:05.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.32,1:22:08.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 一切都准备就绪了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.19,1:22:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到我的暗号之后\N就要急速上升喔
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.19,1:22:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.49,1:22:14.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.70,1:22:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.43,1:22:23.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.54,1:22:30.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.54,1:22:31.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.38,1:22:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.42,1:22:41.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.69,1:22:45.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.29,1:22:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哆啦A梦 我们成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.63,1:22:51.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.83,1:22:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 你表现得太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.20,1:22:56.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用自己的翅膀飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.44,1:22:58.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来腓尼基就…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.97,1:23:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.34,1:23:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.82,1:23:11.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休克枪根本就没有效
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.85,1:23:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真讨厌 还不快给我消失
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.35,1:23:15.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.86,1:23:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让时光机把它带走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.59,1:23:23.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计时器调到零
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.30,1:23:24.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.86,1:23:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时光机开始启动
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.80,1:23:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们快离开
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.60,1:23:32.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.85,1:23:41.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.98,1:23:44.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次是真的成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.58,1:23:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它到哪里去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.28,1:23:49.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是在\N地球还没形成前的宇宙中吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.83,1:23:59.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去告诉大家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.60,1:24:01.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.33,1:24:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要把鸟托邦的大火消灭呢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.90,1:24:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？要怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.64,1:24:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩西的手杖
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.94,1:24:10.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先设定好研钵型
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.61,1:24:12.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.64,1:24:38.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.81,1:24:42.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.14,1:24:43.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.78,1:24:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基已经被消灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.68,1:24:46.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.95,1:24:48.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.05,1:24:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.09,1:24:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样大火就会灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.89,1:24:59.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟托邦得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.03,1:25:01.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.33,1:25:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米露
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.96,1:25:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 这里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.20,1:25:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.53,1:25:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基已经不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.70,1:25:08.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.97,1:25:11.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 你自己能飞了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.97,1:25:12.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.37,1:25:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候不知道为什么\N好像听到伊卡洛斯的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.51,1:25:19.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说“拿出勇气来”
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.42,1:25:30.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像伊卡洛斯\N附身到古斯基身上呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.22,1:25:31.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古斯基 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.02,1:25:35.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 你是人类啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.03,1:25:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.03,1:25:39.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.13,1:25:40.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.10,1:25:42.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.13,1:25:43.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我们没有告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.94,1:25:44.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.64,1:25:47.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都已经知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.61,1:25:48.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.81,1:25:50.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.84,1:25:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在等你们回去呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.01,1:25:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腓尼基往鸟栖木的顶端\N去了之后就…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.41,1:25:56.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是人类耶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.75,1:26:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人是拯救鸟托邦的恩人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.52,1:26:03.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类救了鸟托邦？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.42,1:26:06.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.06,1:26:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.83,1:26:09.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.59,1:26:11.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实不只是我们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.86,1:26:16.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是靠古斯基还有大家\N一起努力才能成功的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.39,1:26:35.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重建工作也很辛苦喔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.55,1:26:38.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要大家同心协力\N一定没问题的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.29,1:26:41.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小哔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.49,1:26:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从今以后人类跟鸟类\N也要相互扶持生活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.77,1:26:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类也不能依赖鸟托邦\N要努力加油才行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.82,1:27:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明年你就可以用自己的翅膀\N参加伊卡洛斯耐力赛了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.99,1:27:12.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.52,1:27:15.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我还要成为一名\N英勇的候鸟巡逻队员
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.03,1:27:18.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来优胜也是非你莫属喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.60,1:27:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很感谢你们大家
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.83,1:27:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会忘记你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.13,1:27:26.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就让我们候鸟巡逻队\N送你们去候鸟航线吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.91,1:27:28.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.17,1:27:30.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？小夫他人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.11,1:27:30.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.61,1:27:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没办法带你回去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.18,1:27:39.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要赶快长大\N然后加入巡逻队喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.25,1:27:41.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到那个时候我会再来看你喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.85,1:27:44.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.69,1:27:47.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.06,1:27:49.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大雄 再见
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.23,1:27:57.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会再来看你的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.84,1:27:59.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.57,1:28:01.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸟托邦

